  <p id="c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan-father-and-cousin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan-father-and-cousin:p001:m0000" ref="0cf_pqs_mnm">王思遠</persName>，琅邪臨沂人。尚書令<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan-father-and-cousin:p001:m0013" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">晏</persName>從弟也。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan-father-and-cousin:p001:m0019" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACABC">羅雲</persName>，平西長史。</p>
